# The hero's head from a distance at noon in the Khorinis market (hair as strands,
# reports/content/2026-11-npc-hair/strands.md): what the strands cost when the head is small in the frame, for the
# levels of detail by distance. The same place and content switches as perf-face.bench; a still after each sample
# shows what was in the frame.
#   BENCH_HOST=ryzen PERF_ENV='OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<content>' scripts/perf.sh face-far
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
cadence normal
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
watch player
cam face 120 40 1
# Ten real seconds after the teleport for loading and native simulation.
wait 10000
perf sample perf-face-far/view-1
wait 8000
perf stop
shot far-120
wait 300
cam face 300 40 1
wait 1500
perf sample perf-face-far/view-2
wait 8000
perf stop
shot far-300
wait 300
cam face 700 40 1
wait 1500
perf sample perf-face-far/view-3
wait 8000
perf stop
shot far-700
wait 300
# from behind: at 40 degrees a wall stands 10 m away
cam face 1500 220 1
wait 1500
perf sample perf-face-far/view-4
wait 8000
perf stop
shot far-1500
wait 300
